Z||000001||bubbajoexx||12-17-2000||10:30 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by bilbo:<BR><B>Will rims off a 1986 trans am gta fit on the fiero?? i know they are 5lug and 16x8.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>NO they are 5X43/4  the fiero uses 5X100mm for 16X8 wheels use 99 Z24 wheels or Barerta GT wheels 16X7 or Grand AM GT 99 16X7 all have the 5X100mm bolt pattern.||||reg||1
